		<div class="container">
		<figure class="flow-figure" aria-labelledby="flow-figure-caption">
			<svg class="fig-pc" viewBox="0 0 1120 330" role="img" aria-label="案件の流れ：見積、受注、納品、請求、保守更新。空き枠カレンダーが見積の前に効く">
